WEBVTT Kind: captions; Language: en

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
This boy and girl coming home from
school look quite content with life.

00:00:21.001 --> 00:00:22.001
And why not?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
They're looking forward to an important date,
dinner at home with the family.

00:00:28.001 --> 00:00:31.001
What's the matter?
Doesn't that sound exciting to you?

00:00:32.001 --> 00:00:36.001
Well, to them it's a special occasion,
as it has been ever since they

00:00:36.001 --> 00:00:38.000
sat down to dinner in high chairs.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Why should they feel that way about something
you take so completely for granted?

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Well, let's see if we can find out.

00:00:48.001 --> 00:00:52.001
First of all, daughter has changed from
school clothes to something more festive.

00:00:53.001 --> 00:00:57.000
Dressing a little makes her feel and
consequently look more charming.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Even the table takes on a special air.

00:01:02.001 --> 00:01:04.001
Mother, too, changes from her daytime clothes.

00:01:05.001 --> 00:01:09.001
The women of this family seem to feel
that they owe it to the men of the family

00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:12.001
to look relaxed, rested,
and attractive at dinnertime.

00:01:15.001 --> 00:01:19.000
Brother is spending an hour
before dinner catching up on his

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.000
homework. He has plans evening.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.001
Perhaps that explains telephone call,
but he won't spend a lot

00:01:26.001 --> 00:01:28.000
of time on the phone either.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:33.001
When there are several members of the
family to be considered, it is not a good

00:01:33.001 --> 00:01:36.001
idea for one member to monopolize the phone.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.001
And it is never good to allow telephone
conversations to interfere with studies.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Hmm, is it that late?
Dad will be here any minute. Better

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.000
tell mother she's needed in the kitchen.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Brother notices the time and realizes that
he must put things in order and clean

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.001
himself up in time for dinner.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.001
Hello there. Junior is always in a hurry,
particularly for dinner.

00:02:17.001 --> 00:02:21.000
But first there's a clean-up
job to do on this young man.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Brother takes it upon himself to help
share Junior's responsibility for keeping

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.001
their room in good order,
and keeping Junior in good order, too.

00:02:37.001 --> 00:02:42.001
Punctuality is stressed in this household.
By that I mean hair is combed and

00:02:42.001 --> 00:02:46.000
faces and hands scrubbed
before the boys come to the

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.001
table so they won't delay the meal.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.001
Now mother and daughter put the
finishing touches on the dinner.

00:03:03.001 --> 00:03:09.000
Father, too, looks forward to this date
with the family. He has had a hard day at

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.001
the office and in his
briefcase are some contracts

00:03:11.001 --> 00:03:13.000
which must be looked over tonight.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:18.000
But in the meantime,
he will relax at dinner with those he loves.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.000
A simple centerpiece made from some flowers
which grow in the backyard is another

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.000
of daughter's contributions to the dinner.

00:03:27.001 --> 00:03:31.001
But it takes up a little too much room,
so she moves it to the sideboard.

00:03:41.001 --> 00:03:47.000
These boys greet their dad as though
they are genuinely glad to see him, as

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:50.000
though they had really missed being
away from him during the day and

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.001
are anxious to talk to him.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:57.001
This is the time for pleasant discussion
in a thoroughly relaxed mood. They don't

00:03:57.001 --> 00:04:01.000
pick this time of the day to spring
unpleasant surprises on dad.

00:04:01.001 --> 00:04:05.001
If they have disagreeable news,
they will postpone the discussion until another

00:04:05.001 --> 00:04:10.001
time. And this is no time to dun father
for a raise in your allowance, new

00:04:10.001 --> 00:04:13.001
clothes,
or argue about other financial matters.

00:04:18.001 --> 00:04:24.000
Ah, dinner time.
Yes, mother, Junior remembered to clean up.

00:04:32.001 --> 00:04:39.000
Brother seats Junior. Then helps mother

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.001
to her chair as he would his best girl.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:55.000
Well, the dinner date has begun,
and they're all happy about it.

00:04:59.001 --> 00:05:04.001
Many families throughout the country
observe the custom of saying grace at meal

00:05:04.001 --> 00:05:09.000
time. It is always treated
with reverence and respect.

00:05:14.001 --> 00:05:20.000
Napkins on the lap, the family awaits service.
They converse pleasantly while dad

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:26.001
serves. I said pleasantly, for that is the
keynote at dinner time. It is not only

00:05:26.001 --> 00:05:28.001
good manners, but good sense.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:37.001
Pleasant, unemotional conversation
helps digestion. Father serves mother

00:05:37.001 --> 00:05:44.001
first, then daughter, then the boys.
Don't worry, fellas, you won't get left.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:06:01.000
Help cut your meat, Junior? Of course.
By example, older

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.001
children can teach younger
ones good table manners.

00:06:10.001 --> 00:06:16.000
No one starts eating until father has
served himself. Always wait for the

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.001
hostess, in this case mother,
to begin eating before you start.

00:06:21.001 --> 00:06:27.000
Let father and mother guide the conversational
trend if they desire. After all,

00:06:27.001 --> 00:06:31.001
they made all this possible and may want
to talk over their day with each other.

00:06:33.001 --> 00:06:39.001
Tell mother how good the food is.
Maybe cess rates a compliment too. It makes

00:06:39.001 --> 00:06:41.000
them want to continue pleasing you.

00:06:43.001 --> 00:06:49.000
Well, all this is good general advice,
but there are some specific don'ts. Maybe

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.000
the family will demonstrate for us.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:57.001
Don't monopolize the conversation and
go on and on without stopping. Nothing

00:06:57.001 --> 00:07:00.000
destroys the charm of a meal more quickly.

00:07:01.001 --> 00:07:06.001
To say that the rest of the group is
bored would be a gross understatement.

00:07:13.001 --> 00:07:19.001
Don't discuss unpleasant topics
such as gruesome sights or sounds

00:07:19.001 --> 00:07:24.001
or unpleasant occurrences.
This is a time of pleasure, of

00:07:24.001 --> 00:07:26.000
charm and relaxation, remember?

00:07:32.001 --> 00:07:38.000
Don't make unkind comparisons about your
stand of living. The dinner table is no

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:44.001
place for discontent. It makes dad
and mother uncomfortable and unhappy.

00:07:54.001 --> 00:07:59.000
Don't insult your brother or sister
with offensive remarks about friends.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:04.001
Arguments, harsh words,
mean tension and distress for everyone.

00:08:14.001 --> 00:08:19.001
Do remember simply this. Treat the other
members of your family with the same

00:08:19.001 --> 00:08:23.001
respect and cordiality you would
show your most treasured friend

00:08:23.001 --> 00:08:25.000
outside the family circle.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:30.001
This does not mean you should be stiff
or formal. With your own family you can

00:08:30.001 --> 00:08:35.001
relax. Be yourself.
Just be sure it's your best self.

00:08:37.001 --> 00:08:42.000
This is better.
Now things are on an even keel again.

00:08:44.001 --> 00:08:50.001
Now we're ready for dessert. Most families
don't have maids so mother needs help

00:08:50.001 --> 00:08:54.001
with the serving from the kitchen.
Son says mother has done

00:08:54.001 --> 00:08:56.000
enough. Watch him play butler.

00:08:59.001 --> 00:09:04.000
The removal of dishes from the main
course and the serving of dessert set the

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.000
stage for the conclusion of
a thoroughly pleasant meal.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:16.001
Do you begin to see now how a date with
your family can be a truly special

00:09:16.001 --> 00:09:20.001
occasion? Do you know why brother and
sister looked forward to the evening?

00:09:23.001 --> 00:09:28.000
When the dinner hour at home is treated
with a certain amount of graciousness and

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:34.000
ceremony it can be memorable.
There is no family so poor but that the evening

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:37.001
meal can be eaten in an atmosphere
of warmth and gentleness.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:44.000
There is no family so busy but that it
can come together in the evening for a

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.001
dinner date which will give its members
something to look back upon with

00:09:47.001 --> 00:09:52.001
happiness all their days. .
